=== A2C: Advantage Actor-Critic on 4×4 GridWorld ===
Actor:  state→32→ReLU→n_actions→Softmax
Critic: state→32→ReLU→1  (V function)
Update: n-step returns (n=5), entropy bonus, epsilon-greedy warmup

Note: on small GridWorlds with sparse + terminal hole rewards,
tabular Q-learning outperforms neural A2C because exact Bellman
propagation avoids function-approximation error in the critic.

A2C avg reward (last 100): -1.117
